Ethical & governance considerations
- Present clear limitations: DP and HE reduce but do not eliminate all risks; threat models include collusion and side-channel leakage.
- Emphasize consent, transparent model governance, and transfer of capacity to local partners to avoid extractive research practices.
- Encourage publication of deployment logs and impact metrics aggregated at non-identifying levels.

